 and tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your newfound allies' influence to unlock new facilities and acquire powerful skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a bond with each noble and delve into their personal story as your relation deepens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will be your allies as you climb to the top and define your legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812860/extras/5a62a2fc2ae77e83e1b6c2d29971922f.poster.avif?t=1769684777\" aria-label=\"Turn based tactics with a dice twist\" width=616 height=401 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812860/extras/5a62a2fc2ae77e83e1b6c2d29971922f.webm?t=1769684777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the battlefield by rolling dice and use them to control your knights in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dice to unleash your characters\u2019 powerful abilities and decimate your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reroll specific dice to be the master of your own fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the roll of the dice to optimise your turn and achieve victory<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812860/extras/690738c8c2308be5cb57281e17fd7965.avif?t=1769684777\" alt=\"Join us on Discord\" width=616 height=119 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Chromatic Ink"],"dlc":[3918910],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor